Ensure subreviewers only modifies a copy of reviewers

- previously, the author of any subproject merge requests would be removed from any subsequent (in order of grape traversal) merge requests

- this corrects the behavior to only remove the author from that subproject's merge request

- this only affects the behavior if some subproject merge requests were created by different authors
